{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792796700, "covers_from": "2026-10-23T23:05:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-23T23:06:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792796760, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-23T23:05:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 66874, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北市大安區現在像大型工地，假日想要睡覺7點就開始車輛進場8點準時施工，下午想要補眠工地也還在施工", "display_name": "大安代表 No.66,874", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T23:05:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 42711, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "主幹道紅綠燈過密，幾乎每兩三個路口就停一次，行車常卡卡的。應該禮讓行人，但也讓綠燈的右轉車常卡在路口", "display_name": "松山代表 No.42,711", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T23:05:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30163, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "環境", "content": "步行環境很差，充斥二手煙、非服務時間的垃圾車就隨意違停在路邊造成氣味干擾，行人無法好好呼吸。", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.30,163", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-23T23:05:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 4027, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "環境", "content": "聽完沈伯洋的微森林政見，我對國際的台北，減碳的台北，綠化的台北更有憧憬了🥰", "display_name": "萬華代表 陳小胖", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 42711, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.42,711", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 30163, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.30,163", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 4027, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 陳小胖", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 44170, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture